672
00:48:04,560 --> 00:48:05,700
when she dies

673
00:48:05,700 --> 00:48:06,180
and meet God

674
00:48:06,180 --> 00:48:06,960
that he's going to tell her

675
00:48:06,960 --> 00:48:07,440
all these things

676
00:48:07,440 --> 00:48:08,180
and he offended her,

677
00:48:08,180 --> 00:48:09,020
but then she says this.

678
00:48:09,020 --> 00:48:10,440
One thing I know for sure

679
00:48:10,440 --> 00:48:12,080
is he can never say

680
00:48:12,080 --> 00:48:14,280
that he did not know me.

681
00:48:16,620 --> 00:48:17,820
Patience in suffering

682
00:48:17,820 --> 00:48:19,800
is not just taking it.

683
00:48:19,800 --> 00:48:23,860
Patience in suffering

684
00:48:23,860 --> 00:48:26,640
is not giving up on God.

685
00:48:26,640 --> 00:48:29,580
Not giving up on God

686
00:48:29,580 --> 00:48:30,080
being our hope.

687
00:48:30,080 --> 00:48:31,440
Not giving up on believing

688
00:48:31,440 --> 00:48:32,240
that God loves us.

689
00:48:32,240 --> 00:48:33,880
Even if we don't understand it,

690
00:48:33,880 --> 00:48:35,440
even if it doesn't make sense,

691
00:48:35,440 --> 00:48:36,460
even if it feels

692
00:48:36,460 --> 00:48:38,080
like he's just staring at us

693
00:48:38,080 --> 00:48:39,320
while our lives fall apart,

694
00:48:39,320 --> 00:48:41,100
that somehow we believe

695
00:48:41,100 --> 00:48:42,220
that he loves us

696
00:48:42,220 --> 00:48:43,500
and he's our redeemer

697
00:48:43,500 --> 00:48:45,260
and that he cares.

698
00:48:45,260 --> 00:48:47,660
And the days

699
00:48:47,660 --> 00:48:48,880
that there's nothing else

700
00:48:48,880 --> 00:48:49,580
that works,

701
00:48:49,580 --> 00:48:51,680
the days that we feel

702
00:48:51,680 --> 00:48:53,440
like nobody else loves us,

703
00:48:53,440 --> 00:48:55,100
that nobody else cares

704
00:48:55,100 --> 00:48:55,320
for us,

705
00:48:55,320 --> 00:48:56,160
the days that we feel

706
00:48:56,160 --> 00:48:57,160
that it's never going

707
00:48:57,160 --> 00:48:57,840
to get better,

708
00:48:57,840 --> 00:48:59,720
at least I know that.

709
00:48:59,720 --> 00:49:02,000
The psalmist says,

710
00:49:02,000 --> 00:49:03,180
even if my mother

711
00:49:03,180 --> 00:49:04,920
and my father reject me,

712
00:49:04,920 --> 00:49:06,460
the Lord will take me in.

713
00:49:06,460 --> 00:49:10,740
Can you hang on to that

714
00:49:10,740 --> 00:49:14,260
when things fall apart?

715
00:49:14,260 --> 00:49:15,340
Can you hang on

716
00:49:15,340 --> 00:49:17,800
to that idea?

717
00:49:17,800 --> 00:49:19,560
Can you refuse

718
00:49:19,560 --> 00:49:22,900
to walk away from God

719
00:49:22,900 --> 00:49:26,420
and believe that he loves us?

720
00:49:26,420 --> 00:49:29,340
That's the only way

721
00:49:29,340 --> 00:49:30,320
that we can make patience.

722
00:49:30,320 --> 00:49:33,080
Will you pray with me?

723
00:49:33,080 --> 00:49:34,360
That's...

724
00:49:34,360 --> 00:49:40,240
I know what I'm going through.

725
00:49:40,740 --> 00:49:43,200
But I don't know

726
00:49:43,200 --> 00:49:43,820
what the people

727
00:49:43,820 --> 00:49:44,460
in this room

728
00:49:44,460 --> 00:49:45,580
are going through.

729
00:49:45,580 --> 00:49:47,480
The chances are

730
00:49:47,480 --> 00:49:47,940
that in a room

731
00:49:47,940 --> 00:49:48,440
this size,

732
00:49:48,440 --> 00:49:50,540
there's some

733
00:49:50,540 --> 00:49:51,940
profound heartbreak,

734
00:49:51,940 --> 00:49:55,080
some profound suffering,

735
00:49:55,080 --> 00:49:56,320
some profound pain.

736
00:49:56,320 --> 00:50:00,040
And my prayer

737
00:50:00,040 --> 00:50:00,500
in this morning

738
00:50:00,500 --> 00:50:00,980
is that

739
00:50:00,980 --> 00:50:03,340
as we continue

740
00:50:03,340 --> 00:50:04,420
to worship you

741
00:50:04,420 --> 00:50:05,220
and

742
00:50:05,220 --> 00:50:07,060
share communion

743
00:50:07,060 --> 00:50:07,440
that

744
00:50:07,440 --> 00:50:10,180
we will all

745
00:50:10,180 --> 00:50:10,760
be reminded

746
00:50:10,760 --> 00:50:13,320
that you love us.

747
00:50:13,320 --> 00:50:16,340
That the comfort

748
00:50:16,340 --> 00:50:17,440
of your presence

749
00:50:17,440 --> 00:50:18,400
would come over us.

750
00:50:18,400 --> 00:50:21,200
And that we will walk

751
00:50:21,200 --> 00:50:22,200
out of this room

752
00:50:22,200 --> 00:50:23,580
with enough faith

753
00:50:23,580 --> 00:50:24,240
to believe

754
00:50:24,240 --> 00:50:25,260
that you care.

755
00:50:28,760 --> 00:50:30,000
that we get to see.
